    "note": "MIGRATION MIRROR (amended 2026-09-07). Runtime SSOT for displayName/reading/gauge is data/tuning/derived-stat-catalog.v{n}.json (+ status/resource/aptitude/element catalogs). This seed file remains until hosts inject those catalogs and SeedCatalogMatchesCode asserts against them. Never generate a player label from the dotted id (GG-62).",
    "notTunables": "Copy still must NOT live in data/tuning/derived-stats.v2.json (that file holds categoryResistCap and turnDefaultSpeed only). Copy lives in *-catalog.v{n}.json — a runtime catalog class, not a balance-number file (tunables-ssot §1).",
    "expand": "Combat families expand over omni + ElementRoster the same way catalog.json does. The player name is family + element noun: Fire Power, Omni Defense. omni renders as Omni, never as a seventh type chip.",
